###############################################################################################################################
### Status machine on @t1 (New -> Open -> PendingCustomer -> OnHold -> Open -> Resolved -> Open -> Resolved -> Closed -> Open -> Cancelled)
###############################################################################################################################

### 21a. Close a New ticket in English - 422 Tickets.TransitionNotAllowed, detail "The ticket is New; that action is not allowed in this status."
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t1Id}}/transitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
Accept-Language: en

{ "action": "Close", "rowVersion": "{{t1.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### 21b. Same in Arabic - 422, Arabic detail naming the status between guillemets
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t1Id}}/transitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
Accept-Language: ar

{ "action": "Close", "rowVersion": "{{t1.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### 22. AwaitCustomer on New - 422 Tickets.TransitionNotAllowed
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t1Id}}/transitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "action": "AwaitCustomer", "rowVersion": "{{t1.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

