### 37. (send it after 39a, on a ticket in a legal state) Stale rowVersion - 409 Persistence.ConcurrencyConflict. The same
### request on the Cancelled @t1 would answer 422 Tickets.TransitionNotAllowed: the status check comes before the save.
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}/transitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "action": "Open", "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" }

### 38. The full history of @t1 - 200: 11 activities (Created + 10 successful transitions), oldest first.
### SQL check: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM tickets.outbox_messages WHERE Content LIKE '%<t1 id>%' -> 11 (one per ticket command).
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t1Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

