### 52. Supervisor transfers @t2 to JED-CARE - 200: departmentId JED-CARE, branchId Jeddah, assignedAgentId null, category null, last
### activity Transferred (from RYD-CARE to JED-CARE), every earlier activity still present. The ticket leaves the sender's scope in
### the same transaction (write guard, plan B1).
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

{ "departmentId": "{{jeCare}}", "rowVersion": "{{t2Assigned.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### 53a. Supervisor reads it afterwards - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 53b. Agent A reads it afterwards - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 54a. Agent B reads it - 200, same history
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentBToken}}

### 54b. Agent B claims it - 200
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{t2Id}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{agentBToken}}

### 55a. Admin creates department RYD-TKT - 200 (409 Organisation.DepartmentCodeTaken on a second run)
# @name ticketDesk
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/Departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "branchId": "{{riyadhBranch}}", "code": "RYD-TKT", "nameAr": "قسم التذاكر", "nameEn": "Ticket Desk" }

### 55b. Admin deactivates it - 200
# @name ticketDeskOff
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/Departments/{{ticketDesk.response.body.id}}/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rowVersion": "{{ticketDesk.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### 55c. Supervisor transfers @race to the inactive department - 422 Tickets.TargetDepartmentInactive
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{race.response.body.id}}/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

{ "departmentId": "{{ticketDesk.response.body.id}}", "rowVersion": "{{race.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

###############################################################################################################################
### Queues and search
###############################################################################################################################

### 56. Queue counts - 200 { mine, unassigned, all } consistent with 57-59
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 57. Mine - 200: T-000002 was transferred away; the seeded ticket is gone from A's scope. EF log: SELECT lists only [t].[...]
### columns of [tickets].[Tickets] (no TicketActivities join) with [t].[TenantId] = @..., [t].[BranchId] IN ..., [t].[DepartmentId] IN ...
### and [t].[IsDeleted] = CAST(0 AS bit)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?queue=mine
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 58. Unassigned - 200: T-000001 and other unassigned working tickets; never T-000003 (JED-CARE)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?queue=unassigned
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 59. All, status Cancelled - 200: @t1. EF log: [t].[Status] IN (N'Cancelled') (or OPENJSON) with the converted value
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?queue=all&status=Cancelled
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 60a. Search by number fragment - 200
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?search=T-00000
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 60b. Search by Arabic subject fragment (استرداد, percent-encoded) - 200: @t1
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?search=%D8%A7%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%B1%D8%AF%D8%A7%D8%AF
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 61a. High and Urgent, by priority descending, page 1 of size 2 - 200. EF log: [t].[Priority] IN (3, 4), ORDER BY [t].[Priority] DESC,
### [t].[Number] and OFFSET ... FETCH
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?priority=High&priority=Urgent&sort=priority&descending=true&page=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 61b. Page 2 - 200: distinct items; total = the unpaged count
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?priority=High&priority=Urgent&sort=priority&descending=true&page=2&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 62a. By customer - 200
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?customerId={{ahmed}}&queue=all
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 62b. By category - 200. EF log: [t].[CategoryId] = @...
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?categoryId={{ryCareGeneral}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 62c. By assignee - 200
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?assigneeId={{agentA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 62d. By a department outside the caller's scope - 200 with an EMPTY page, not 403
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?departmentId={{jeCare}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 63a. Bad queue - 400 errors.Queue
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?queue=bogus
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 63b. Bad sort - 400 errors.Sort
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?sort=bogus
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 63c. Bad status - 400 errors.Statuses[0]
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?status=Bogus
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 63d. Bad page size - 400 errors.PageSize
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?pageSize=0
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 64. Agent B lists everything - 200: only JED-CARE tickets (T-000003, @t2 after the transfer)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets?queue=all
Authorization: Bearer {{agentBToken}}

### 65a-0. Read the Technical category for its rowVersion - 200
# @name ryCareTechnicalVersion
GET {{host}}/api/Admin/TicketCategories/{{ryCareTechnical}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 65a. Admin deactivates the Technical category - 200
# @name techOff
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/TicketCategories/{{ryCareTechnical}}/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rowVersion": "{{ryCareTechnicalVersion.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### 65b. Read the seeded Najd ticket T-000002 as agent A - 200 with category.isActive false and its name still present
### (only if T-000002 is still in RYD-CARE: it was transferred by 52 when that request ran first)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{najdOpenTicket}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 65c. Agent picker - 200: Technical absent
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/TicketCategories
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 65d. Admin reactivates it - 200
POST {{host}}/api/Admin/TicketCategories/{{ryCareTechnical}}/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "rowVersion": "{{techOff.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

###############################################################################################################################
### Authentication and not-found
###############################################################################################################################

### 66. No token - 401
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets

### 67a. Unknown ticket - 404 Tickets.TicketNotFound
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{unknown}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 67b. The JED-CARE seeded ticket as agent A - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{redSeaNewTicket}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
